{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792332170,"nonce":"4MiokAUqJuU0Epac4JKOwzETUiE=","title":"DropdownMenu has no submenus and no checkable items","message":"**What is wanted**\nRayDE's terminal menu (the chevron beside +) wants a Profiles submenu with the default profile ticked, and Split Terminal with Profile and Select Default Profile as submenus. RayDE routes those through a command-center picker today, a different gesture from the menu a user expects.\n\n**What would remove the workaround**\nA submenu item that opens a second floating menu to the side on hover or ArrowRight and closes on ArrowLeft.\nA checkable item with a leading check mark and aria-checked, and a radio-group variant for picking one of several.\n\n**Reported by** chimpmonk-af, RayDE session.","files":null}]}